{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台預料一道冷鋒將於周三（18日）稍後橫過華南沿岸，北風增強及有幾陣雨，氣溫顯著下降。本港周三稍後轉吹偏北風，雲量增多，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日顯著轉涼，周五（20日）及周六（21日）市區最低氣溫在15°C、16°C左右，新界相當清涼。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.162055+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:04:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:42:01.828581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:48.028780+00:00","content_hash":"a808be3506f5203a87e327e5049896dcd3b48417066c7ef9f7be69a31cbfcf3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}